                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/releases/tag/11.3.1"&gt;11.3.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/compare/11.3.0...11.3.1"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;11.3.0...11.3.1&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Enhancements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update SkiaSharp and HarfBuzzSharp version to support LA64 and RV64 by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/4Darmygeometry/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/4Darmygeometry"&gt;@4Darmygeometry&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2964979216" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18571" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18571/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18571"&gt;#18571&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improved inline documentation of class event handler methods by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/TomEdwardsEnscape/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/TomEdwardsEnscape"&gt;@TomEdwardsEnscape&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3065736277" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18869" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18869/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18869"&gt;#18869&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduce allocations in &lt;code&gt;TextShaperImpl&lt;/code&gt; by reusing HarfBuzz Buffer by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/dme-compunet/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/dme-compunet"&gt;@dme-compunet&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3075884317" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18892" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18892/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18892"&gt;#18892&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update azure-pipelines.yml (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3070292688" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18876" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18876/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18876"&gt;#18876&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Gillibald/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Gillibald"&gt;@Gillibald&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3096294067" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18940" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18940/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18940"&gt;#18940&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Don't expect WasmRuntimeAssetsLocation to be always set by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/maxkatz6/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/maxkatz6"&gt;@maxkatz6&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3098874652" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18947" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18947/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18947"&gt;#18947&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bump Angle version by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/maxkatz6/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/maxkatz6"&gt;@maxkatz6&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3112336721" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18982" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18982/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18982"&gt;#18982&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix TextBox multiline selection with up/down keys till start/end of text by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/rastislavsvoboda/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/rastislavsvoboda"&gt;@rastislavsvoboda&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3023977844" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18746" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18746/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18746"&gt;#18746&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multiple TextLine.GetTextRunBounds fixes by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Gillibald/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Gillibald"&gt;@Gillibald&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3024732075" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18749" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18749/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18749"&gt;#18749&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invalidate ScrollContentPresenter measure on Can...Scroll by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/BAndysc/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/BAndysc"&gt;@BAndysc&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3026342509" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18753" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18753/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18753"&gt;#18753&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix incorrect CandidateWindow position when using Pinyin IMEs in Windows by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/realybin/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/realybin"&gt;@realybin&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3031026470" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18759" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18759/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18759"&gt;#18759&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve pen secondary button handling on list box by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/maxkatz6/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/maxkatz6"&gt;@maxkatz6&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3033154412" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18766" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18766/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18766"&gt;#18766&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix crash with samsung keyboard when using password textboxes by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/emmauss/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/emmauss"&gt;@emmauss&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3039432786" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18793" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18793/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18793"&gt;#18793&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix caret handles not updating to the latest caret points by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/emmauss/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/emmauss"&gt;@emmauss&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3039457489" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18794" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18794/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18794"&gt;#18794&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix an issue where input controls initialized with &lt;code&gt;InputMethod.IsInputMethodEnable=false&lt;/code&gt; could still use IME in their initial state. by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/comesx4/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/comesx4"&gt;@comesx4&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3048995496" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18816" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18816/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18816"&gt;#18816&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prevent children of UniformGrid from having negative dimensions when row/col spacing exceeds available space by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/H0tCh0colat3/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/H0tCh0colat3"&gt;@H0tCh0colat3&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3053527516" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18832" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18832/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18832"&gt;#18832&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix insets on android 15 by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/emmauss/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/emmauss"&gt;@emmauss&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3056311997" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18844" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18844/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18844"&gt;#18844&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed rare soft-"freezes" with OnRender(c) { ...; InvalidateVisual(); . } pattern by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/kekekeks/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/kekekeks"&gt;@kekekeks&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3081451222" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18901" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18901/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18901"&gt;#18901&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix focus not being lost when a parent element is hidden by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/TomEdwardsEnscape/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/TomEdwardsEnscape"&gt;@TomEdwardsEnscape&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3089252060" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18916" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18916/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18916"&gt;#18916&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove Keyboard Theme Override by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/drasticactions/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/drasticactions"&gt;@drasticactions&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3090169220" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18922" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18922/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18922"&gt;#18922&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
