&lt;li&gt;Fixed RectangleGeometry not cloning its radius properties by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/TomEdwardsEnscape/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/TomEdwardsEnscape"&gt;@TomEdwardsEnscape&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3094243703" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/18934" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18934/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/18934"&gt;#18934&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
